    {
      "id": "5993fd9f-fdda-5250-8960-f8675a03b48c",
      "type": "Dialog",
      "name": "Dialog",
      "localId": 3,
      "x": 340,
      "y": 40,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "speakerId": "0a3f02b0-80bb-5e10-8f8d-897f9e479f2a",
      "content": "감독님! 오늘 확실히 늘었어요. 느낌이 와요.",
      "statements": [],
      "childFlowId": null,
      "labelIds": [],
      "translations": {
        "content": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "Coach! I definitely got better today. I can feel it.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "87dc7a98-e536-5e1a-91ed-7152da419d52",
      "type": "Dialog",
      "name": "Dialog",
      "localId": 4,
      "x": 640,
      "y": 40,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "speakerId": "23f70dcf-de2b-50ea-a210-97bcdd22d3a0",
      "content": "나도 봤어. 움직임이 달라졌더라.",
      "statements": [],
      "childFlowId": null,
      "labelIds": [],
      "translations": {
        "content": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "I saw it too. Your movement was different.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "b992eb6e-8550-51d3-ab02-298151772e1a",
      "type": "Comment",
      "name": "Comment",
      "localId": 5,
      "x": 340,
      "y": -220,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "text": "오전 만남 이벤트 설정",
      "width": 260,
      "height": 110,
      "attachments": [
        {
          "nodeId": "5993fd9f-fdda-5250-8960-f8675a03b48c"
        }
      ],
      "sharedValues": {
        "b394601c-7a00-5531-95e7-975cf63f1d20": "talk",
        "4de92a9a-ad6d-5d1a-a3e1-a8c8e23af6b9": -1,
        "a669b71f-2828-5827-957c-6123119792ce": 0,
        "72a27a59-bf4a-50f6-8093-f16566f1092b": "ups>=1",
        "65e58623-081e-5c3d-82ef-6d5a377455ff": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "0b2a9c6a-d531-5281-9478-ff6d6dfc0f03",
      "type": "Select",
      "name": "Select",
      "localId": 6,
      "x": 940,
      "y": 40,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "8d19af50-4ab9-577c-99ae-e8188b86488c",
          "text": "이 감각 잊지 말고 계속 가자.",
          "sharedValues": {
            "a32af032-8386-5680-9f52-d9eec9a20d93": "trust:+3;pmod:all:+1:-1"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "8757299d-bf67-51b0-8b65-a6402c2c6f97",
          "text": "들뜨지 마. 아직 갈 길이 멀어.",
          "sharedValues": {
            "a32af032-8386-5680-9f52-d9eec9a20d93": "ok>pmod:all:+2:-1;ng>trust:-2"
          }
        }
      ],
      "translations": {
        "opt:8d19af50-4ab9-577c-99ae-e8188b86488c": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "Hold on to that feeling and keep going.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        },
        "opt:8757299d-bf67-51b0-8b65-a6402c2c6f97": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "Don't get carried away. There's a long way to go.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "bc0e43ee-77fd-5b6b-afb4-6e4357b54ab2",
      "type": "Dialog",
      "name": "Dialog",
      "localId": 7,
      "x": 1240,
      "y": -90,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "speakerId": "0a3f02b0-80bb-5e10-8f8d-897f9e479f2a",
      "content": "네! 내일도 이렇게만 하면 좋겠어요.",
      "statements": [],
      "childFlowId": null,
      "labelIds": [],
      "translations": {
        "content": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "Yes! I hope tomorrow goes just like this.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "73ae489c-167f-572b-8c58-7cd2a58834ed",
      "type": "Dialog",
      "name": "Dialog",
      "localId": 8,
      "x": 1240,
      "y": 170,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "speakerId": "0a3f02b0-80bb-5e10-8f8d-897f9e479f2a",
      "content": "…맞아요. 정신 차릴게요.",
      "statements": [],
      "childFlowId": null,
      "labelIds": [],
      "translations": {
        "content": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "...You're right. I'll stay focused.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      },
      "sharedValues": {
        "a1f512b0-1301-5e9e-871e-fbd1b1426009": "ok"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "120b8a39-3301-5aa0-a1bc-57605c95bd1b",
      "type": "Dialog",
      "name": "Dialog",
      "localId": 9,
      "x": 1540,
      "y": 170,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "speakerId": "0a3f02b0-80bb-5e10-8f8d-897f9e479f2a",
      "content": "칭찬 한 번 듣기가 이렇게 어렵네요.",
      "statements": [],
      "childFlowId": null,
      "labelIds": [],
      "translations": {
        "content": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "Getting one compliment out of you is so hard.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      },
      "sharedValues": {
        "a1f512b0-1301-5e9e-871e-fbd1b1426009": "ng"
      }
    }
  ],
